SK Matrix additions include the single-window multi-account runtime, isolated
account profiles, live video mosaic, shared API configuration and quota gate,
background viewport handling, account lifecycle controls, visual identity,
and the Windows-focused distribution workflow.

SK Matrix is independently maintained. It is not an official Chaoxing product
and is not presented as an original rewrite of all upstream components.
